// A torn byte drops, so a quote behind it still drops.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE torn ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG torn law

IMPULSE torn 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "torn" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
